{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n\nBug does not occur in v4.4.stable.official\nI open the same project in v.4.5.beta.1official, the bug now occurs.\nI exit and re-open the project just opened in 4.5beta back to the original 4.4 stable. Bug no longer occurs.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta1 - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 31.0.15.4630) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600H with Radeon Graphics (12 threads) - 13.85 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nSee video. Rightclicking folders in v.4.5.beta.1 (within the FileSystem tab) makes the popup menu completel y blank, with no visible options in the dropdown menu. The bug does not occur if I create a new folder, until it's first clicked, then it too stays blank. \n\nThe bug does not occur on a fresh project made in 4.5.1beta. However, making a new one in 4.4 and then opening in 4.5 beta makes the bug appear again. Going back to 4.4 makes the bug disappear (until going back to 4.5).\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dea6033e-40f0-46c5-9037-c169203cb746\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1) Make a new Godot project in v.4.4.\n2) Add some folders (nested?), save.\n3) Open the same project in v.4.5.beta.1\n4) Try rightclicking folders in FileSystem, it will likely goblank. If not, try click again, open-reopen, mess-around with folders, and they will eventually all go blank.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[broken_folders.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20847098/broken_folders.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/